      "worked_solution": "Since the exterior angles of a triangle sum to ${360}^{∘}$, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}8x+(14x+{2}^{∘})+(12x+{18}^{∘}) & ={360}^{∘} \\\\ 34x+{20}^{∘} & ={360}^{∘} \\\\ 34x & ={340}^{∘} \\\\ x & ={10}^{∘}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
